## License audit of the wheel (2026-11-07)

An independent audit of the wheel contents found:

- The wheel's `licenses/LICENSE` is byte-identical (same SHA-256,
  `c71d239d...`) to the `LICENSE` of `vllm-project/vllm` and of
  `eagle-hq/vllm`: the license text was not altered by the fork.
- SPDX identifiers in the wheel sources: 2,628 × Apache-2.0, 1,045 ×
  BSD-3-Clause, 103 × MIT. No GPL/AfferoGPL text, no `LicenseRef` /
  source-available identifiers.
- All vendored BSD-3-Clause and MIT files carry their copyright notices, with
  one known exception inherited from upstream (a single MiniMax FMHA header,
  `third_party/fmha_sm100/csrc/include/dequant_nvfp4_e4m3.cuh`, tagged MIT
  without a copyright line).

